mium cards (K or 2), and forces either my teammate to play higher or the Landlord to use valuable resources.\n\nReason: Playing ♥Q is efficient - it beats the Landlord\'s ♠8 without wasting my premium cards (♣K or ♠2). Taking control now prevents the Landlord (who only has 7 cards) from dictating the game flow. I preserve my ♠2 for critical situations and maintain ♣K as a strong backup option.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♥Q"]}'}
